@startuml
title BFD - Chuc nang gui email

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #475569
    FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "Gui email" as Email #E3F2FD
rectangle "Email xac thuc tai khoan" as Verify #ECFDF5
rectangle "Email dat lai mat khau" as Reset #ECFDF5
rectangle "Email ve dien tu" as Ticket #ECFDF5
rectangle "Email thong bao huy suat" as Cancel #FFFBEB
rectangle "Mail Service Provider" as Provider #F3E8FF

Email --> Verify
Email --> Reset
Email --> Ticket
Email --> Cancel
Verify --> Provider : Gui lien ket xac thuc
Reset --> Provider : Gui lien ket dat lai mat khau
Ticket --> Provider : Gui thong tin ve va QR tung ghe
Cancel --> Provider : Gui ly do huy va thong tin hoan tien

note bottom of Provider
Trong bao cao nen dung ten "Mail Service".
SMTP chi la giao thuc/cau hinh ky thuat ben duoi.
end note

@enduml

